<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chikalata chachilembekwe ni Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chikalata chiŵalembile</para>
  <para style="mt1">Che Yuda</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chikalata chi chikuŵilanjikwa Yuda pakuŵa jwalembile akuŵilanjikwa che Yuda. Che Yuda aliŵalanjile nsyene kuti ali mpwakwe che Yakobo, juŵaliji mpwakwe Che Yesu. Kwapele ikukulupilichika kuti che Yuda ali jumo jwa achapwakwe Che Yesu, Yuda liunjili lyandanda. Ngatukumanyilila iŵaga chikalata chi chatumikwe kwa ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito ŵa mpingo umo, nambo kwa agala gagali Mmalangano gakalakala, ikuloleka kuti ŵandu ŵa kuundanda ŵaŵalembelwe ni che Yuda ŵaliji Ŵayahudi. Namuno chikalata chakwe chikulosya kuti ŵaalembele ŵaŵaŵilanjikwe, “Ŵakunonyelwa ni Akunnungu Atati ni ŵakugosekwa kwa ligongo lya Che Yesu Kilisito,” Yakobo liunjili lyandanda. Iyoyo chikalata chi chikulosya kuti chilembekwe mpela mu yaka ya 60 pakumala kupagwa Che Yesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nningwa wao wa kulemba chikalata chi uli kwajamuka ŵandu ŵakunkulupilila Kilisito wose akalambuchikwa ni ŵakwiganya ŵa unami, Yuda liunjili lya 4. Ajigele kumbukumbu sya indu iyakopochele mu Malangano gakalakala ni kugapa machili maloŵe gakwe. Iyoyo mu chikalata chi kwana ngani syasikulanda ni ngani syasili mu chikalata chaaŵili chi che Petulo syasikulosya ngani ja nkati kwajamuka ŵakwiganya ŵa unami, Yuda liunjili lyancheche, 2 Petulo 2:1, ni ngani sya achikatumetume ŵakwinani ni musi wa ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Che Yuda akutanda kuchilemba chikalata chakwe kwa kulimanyukusya nsyene kwa ŵakusyoma ŵakwe, Yuda liunjili lya 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Akuŵecheta yankati nningwa wao wa kulemba chikalata chi, kwajamuka ŵandu yankati ŵakwiganya ŵa unami, Yuda liunjili lya 1:3-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Akutupa chisyasyo kutyochela kwa ŵandu ni yaikopochele Mmalangano gakalakala, Yuda liunjili lya 1:5-16.</para>
  <para style="io">Akwasalila yakuti pakusachilwa kulisepusya ni majiganyo ga unami, Yuda liunjili lya 1:17-23.</para>
  <para style="io">Akumalichisya chikalata chakwe kwakwatogolela Akunnungu, Yuda liunjili lya 1:24-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Uneji che Yuda jundi jwakutumichila ju Che Yesu Kilisito ni mpwao che Yakobo, ngunnembela ŵanyamwe ummilanjikwe ni Akunnungu ni ŵakunonyelwa ni Akunnungu Atati ni Che Yesu Kilisito ŵakungosa ŵanyamwe.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Ngwapopelela Akunnungu kuti chanasa ni chitendewele ni unonyelo ichuluche kukwenu.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakwiganya ŵa unami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Achambusanga ŵangu, panaliji nkulimbichila kunlembela nkati ukulupusyo watuli nawo uwe wose, naiweni yambone kunlembela ni kunlimbisya ntima kwa ligongo lya kuchichenjela chikulupi, Akunnungu chiŵapele ŵandu ŵao kamope kwa katema kose. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Pakuŵa ŵandu ŵangakwajogopa Akunnungu ŵaŵajinjile kwa chisyepela mu mpingo mwetu. Ŵandu wo atindenye utenga wa umbone wa Akunnungu ŵetu kuti atende chikululu, ni kwakana Che Yesu Kilisito jwaali Chilongola ni Ambuje pe. Nambo Malembelo ga Akunnungu galondwele chitandile kalakala kuti kulamulikwa kukwalolela ŵandu wo.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Namose nkuimanyilila yeleyi yose, ngusaka kunkumbusya yatite Ambuje pakwakulupusya Ŵaisilaeli kutyochela ku Misili, kanyuma kakwe ŵaauleje aŵala wose ŵaŵakanile kukulupilila. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Ni achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵanganakwanikwa ni ulamusi wao, ni kupaleka paŵasachilwe kutama, Akunnungu ŵaŵisile mu chipi ni kwataŵa kwa nyolo moŵa gose pangali mbesi kwa ligongo lya kulamulikwa pa lyuŵa lyekulungwa lila. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Iyoyopeyo, ŵandu ŵa ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola ni misi jajiŵandikene nawo ŵalinonyelesye kwa chigwagwa ni kupanganya indu yangaikusachilwa kutendekwa pa chiilu. Alamulikwe kwa kutama pa mooto wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi kuti aŵe chitagu kwa ŵandu ŵane.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Iyoyo ni yatite kuŵa ŵandu wa, sagamisi syao sikwalongosya kuchisakasya chiilu chao achinsyene, ni kuujalusya ulamusi wa Akunnungu ni kwatukana achikatumetume ŵa Akunnungu ŵakwete ukulu kwinani. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Nambo namose Mikaeli katumetume jwankulu jwa kwinani paŵakanilanaga ni Shetani nkati chiilu chi che Musa, nganalinga kwalalatila, nambo ŵatite, “Ambuje ankalipile.” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Nambo ŵandu ŵa, akuitukana yaili yose yanganaimanyilila. Kwana indu yakuimanyilila nambo akuitendekanya pangaganisya mpela inyama yaikuti kupanganya pangali lunda, ni yele indu ikwajonanga achinsyene. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Ulaje uŵe kukwao, pakuŵa ŵandu wo akuiye litala li che Kaini. Kwa liwamba lya tama ja kukola ipanje agwilenje mu chileŵo chiŵapanganyisye che Balaamu. Pakuŵa ŵatindigenye mpela iŵatindigenye che Kola ni ŵaulajikwe mpela iŵaulajikwe che Kola. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Ŵandu ŵa akwika ku chindimba chenu cha chakulya chachikulosya unonyelo, ŵanya ŵa ali ŵakwajogopa pakuŵa kwa wende wao wangalumbana akutaga soni. Ŵanya wo akulandana ni ŵakuchinga ŵakujijikutisya achinsyene pe. Ŵanya wo ali mpela maunde gangali ula gagakujigalikwa ni mbungo. Akulandana ni itela yaipukutiche masamba, yangali isogosi yetupulwe ni kuumula chwa. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Ŵandu ŵa ali mpela matumbela gakalipa ga mu bahali, ni ipanganyo yao ya soni ikukopoka nti chiulo. Ŵandu ŵa ali mpela ndondwa syasikwendajenda, syasiŵichikwe pa chipi cha moŵa gose pangali mbesi.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Ni che Enoki, mundu jwa uŵelesi wa saba chitandile che Adamu ŵalondwele nkati ŵandu ŵa, achitiji, “Mpilikane naweni Ambuje achiikaga ni mianda kwa mianda ja achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵakwe ŵaswela, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />kukwalamula ŵandu wose ni kukwajamuka wose ŵangakwajogopa Akunnungu, kwa ligongo lya ipanganyo yao yangalumbana iŵapanganyisye, pamo ni maloŵe ga wamba gakuŵecheta ŵandu ŵa sambi, ga kwatukana Akunnungu.”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Ŵandu ŵa ali ŵa kusongoneka ni kwaŵecheta ŵandu ŵane, ni akutamanga malinga ni tama syao syangalumbana. Akulifuna ni kwalapa ŵandu ŵane kwa ligongo lya kupoka kwao achinsyene.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majamuko ni malajisyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Nambo ŵanyamwe achambusanga ŵangu, ngakumbuchile maloŵe gaŵagasasile kalakala achinduna ŵa Ambuje ŵetu Che Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Ŵansalile mwanya yakuti, “Pa moŵa gambesi, chaachikopochela ŵandu ŵangakwajogopa Akunnungu achitamaga malinga ni tama syao syangalumbana. Ni ŵanyawo chansechanje ŵanyamwe.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Ŵeleŵa ali ŵandu ŵachansapulanye mwanya, ŵandu ŵakusikuya tama syao siŵapagwile nasyo, ŵanganakola Mbumu jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Nambo ŵanyamwe achambusanga ŵangu, njendelechele kulitaŵa pa nsingi wa chikulupi chenu chachiswela nnope, ni kupopela kwa machili ga Mbumu jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Ntame mu unonyelo wa Akunnungu nchalolelaga Ambuje ŵetu Che Yesu Kilisito kuti kwa chanasa chakwe ampeleche ku umi wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Mwakolele chanasa ŵandu ŵane ŵaali ni lipamba, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />ni ŵandu ŵane mwakulupusye kwakwanyakula kwatyosya pa mooto. Ni ŵane mwakolele chanasa nchililolesyaga, nchimeje tama syao syangalumbana nchichimaga namose iwalo yao yaili ni madoa ga tama syao syangalumbana.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapopelo ga kwalapa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Akunnungu akukombola kungosa kuti nkagwa mu sambi, ni kumpeleka mpaka mu ukulu wao kwa lukondwa lwakupunda akuno ndi nganikola chileŵo. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Ŵelewo ŵaali Akunnungu ŵamope, Nkulupusyo jwetu, akole ukulu, ni umwenye ni ukombole ni ulamusi kwa litala lya Che Yesu Kilisito Ambuje ŵetu, chitandile kalakala, sambano ni moŵa gose pangali mbesi! Eloo.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>